{"Title":"An Act prohibiting profiling of motorcyclists and motorcycle-only checkpoints","BillNumber":"S1525","DocketNumber":"SD2211","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"BRF0","Name":"Barry R. Finegold","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BRF0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T19:54:28.933"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":null,"Name":"Paul W. Cote","Type":3,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T19:54:28.9333333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S1525/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Finegold (by request), a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1525) of Paul W. Cote for legislation to prohibit profiling of motorcyclists and motorcycle-only checkpoints.  Public Safety and Homeland Security.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. No law enforcement officer or agency shall establish or conduct “motorcycle-only” checkpoints.\r\n\t(1) The criminal justice training commission shall ensure that issues related to motorcycle profiling are addressed in basic law enforcement training and offered to in-service law enforcement officers in conjunction with existing training regarding profiling.\r\n\t(2) Local law enforcement agencies shall add a statement condemning motorcycle profiling to existing policies regarding profiling.\r\n\t(3) For the purposes of this section, \"motorcyclist profiling\" means the illegal use of the fact that a person rides a motorcycle or wears motorcycle-related paraphernalia as a factor in deciding to stop and question, take enforcement action, arrest, or search a person or vehicle with or without an otherwise legal basis under the United States Constitution or Massachusetts Constitution.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J22","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J22"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}